			],
			"Message": "chore(deps): Update GitHub Actions dependencies and timestamp\n\nThis commit updates several GitHub Actions dependencies to their latest versions:\n- `dependabot/fetch-metadata` updated from `v2.4.0` to `v2.5.0` in both Dependabot workflows.\n- `actions/setup-node` updated from `v6.1.0` to `v6.2.0` in both NPM and Node workflows.\n\nAdditionally, the timestamp in `.github/Update.md` has been refreshed to reflect the current date.\n\nThese updates ensure the project leverages the latest features, security patches, and performance improvements from the GitHub Actions ecosystem.",
			"SHA": "3f3e73482bdb109245c18ddfa587d681c0555119"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-01-18T03:54:12Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				5004,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs: Update homepage URL and bump dev dependencies\n\n- Updated the `homepage` field in `package.json` to point to the correct README tab URL.\n- Upgraded `@types/node` from version `25.0.3` to `25.0.9`.\n- Upgraded `@webgpu/types` from version `0.1.68` to `0.1.69`.\n\nThese changes ensure accurate project metadata and keep development dependencies up to date with the latest type definitions.",
			"SHA": "6afc7a82b06af1f8ddc6eb612e7a24e40730b1ad"
		},
