			],
			"Message": "chore(release): Update @playform/build to v0.2.6 and remove --provenance flag\n\nThis commit updates the development dependency @playform/build from version 0.2.5 to 0.2.6 in package.json. Additionally, the --provenance flag has been removed from the npm publish command in the GitHub Actions workflow (.github/workflows/NPM.yml). This aligns the publishing process with current best practices and resolves potential compatibility issues during the release pipeline.",
